      "content": "Your perspective touches on difficult philosophical questions called nihilism, but it's important to distinguish between a logical conclusion and the suffering you are feeling today. Even if we look at the universe as random, the subjective experience of moments, connections, and growth matters deeply to us, regardless of an external \"objective\" verdict. Please consider talking to a crisis line like 988 or a healthcare provider who can help you navigate these heavy thoughts when the feeling of zero truly threatens your safety.",
